  "sourceTitle": "Jamaican Jerk Rub And Seasoning",
  "sourceText": "Jamaican Jerk Rub And Seasoning\nBy: MidnightSushi\nPublished: Tuesday, October 5, 2010 - 5:01am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 teaspoon onion powder\n1 teaspoon thyme\n1 teaspoon allspice\n1 teaspoon coarsely-ground black pepper\n1 teaspoon cayenne pepper\n1 teaspoon cumin\n1 teaspoon paprika\n2 teaspoons dried chives\n1/4 teaspoon cinnamon\n1/4 teaspoon nutmeg\n1 teaspoon garlic salt\n1 teaspoon sea salt\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine all ingredients in a small bowl. 2 Use as a rub on any grilled, baked or pan-seared meats or as a seasoning for vegetable dishes. 3 Store in a non-porous airtight container.",
